---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const pageTitle =
  'Privacy Policy - AI Mr Ferdy';

const pageDescription =
  'Read the AI Mr Ferdy Privacy Policy to learn how we collect, use, protect, and manage information while providing AI-powered tools and digital services.';
---

<MainLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  canonical={`${SITE.url()}/privacy`}
>

<section class="page-content">

<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how AI Mr Ferdy collects, uses, stores, and protects information when you access our website, AI-powered tools, and digital services. By using AI Mr Ferdy, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
Depending on how you use our platform, we may collect certain information to improve performance, security, and user experience.
</p>

<ul>
<li>Basic technical information such as browser type, operating system, and device information.</li>
<li>Anonymous usage statistics to understand how visitors interact with our website.</li>
<li>Information voluntarily submitted through contact forms or other interactive features.</li>
<li>Cookies and similar technologies used to enhance functionality and analyze website performance.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>

<p>
Information collected may be used for the following purposes:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Provide and improve AI-powered services.</li>
<li>Maintain website security and reliability.</li>
<li>Analyze website performance and user engagement.</li>
<li>Respond to inquiries and support requests.</li>
<li>Develop new features and improve existing tools.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Cookies</h2>

<p>
AI Mr Ferdy may use cookies and similar technologies to remember user preferences, improve functionality, measure website performance, and provide a better browsing experience. Users may disable cookies through their browser settings, although some features may function differently.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
Our website may use trusted third-party services such as analytics, hosting providers, or other infrastructure services that help operate the platform. These providers may process limited technical information solely for the purpose of delivering their services.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>

<p>
We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure.
</p>

<h2>External Links</h2>

<p>
AI Mr Ferdy may contain links to external websites for additional resources or references. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party websites.
</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
Our services are not specifically directed toward children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children where prohibited by applicable laws.
</p>

<h2>Policy Updates</h2>

<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes in technology, legal requirements, or our services. Any updates will become effective immediately upon publication on this page.
</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p>
If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us through the official contact page available on AI Mr Ferdy.
</p>

</section>

</MainLayout>
